# NPM Ignore

# ignore everything
*

# ... but these files
!package.json
!tsconfig.json
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!core/dist/**
!core/bundle/**
!core/types/**

# The source masters behind the icon/logo artwork -- 800x800 and 1024x1024 originals, ~2.6 MB in
# total, kept only so the small derived favicons can be regenerated. The allowlist above already
# excludes all of `docs/`, so this is a guard rather than the rule doing the work today: if
# anything under `docs/` is ever published, the masters must not go with it.
docs/images/master/**